flowchart LR
  roster[(Crew roster<br/>names and IDs removed)] --> head[Headroom per flight<br/>max FDP − planned FDP<br/>of the tightest crew member]
  histc[(Flight-number history)] -->|no roster| est[10th percentile estimate<br/>labelled estimated]
  head --> chk
  est --> chk
  opt[Each recovery option<br/>delayed flights + extra minutes] --> chk{Delay vs headroom}
  chk -->|≥ 30 min left| ok[ok]
  chk -->|< 30 min left| tight[tight]
  chk -->|past max FDP| breach[breach]
  breach --> alert[Crew FDPs alert in the scenario<br/>for crew control to review]
  breach --> ag[Agent reports it as a risk]
  roster --> mcard[Model Card: FDP analysis<br/>35,021 duties, median 275 min,<br/>+60 min → 4.3% over]
